  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Variant Picker\n\nA product card with colour swatches and sizes: a cursor taps one colour and one size, the product shape changes tint, a ring moves to the chosen swatch and the chosen size fills. Product, price, colours, sizes and the two choices are variables.\n\nCategory: commerce. Length: 6 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- Showing that a product comes in colours and sizes and how easy it is to pick.\n- An online shop's product page moment in a promo.\n\nAvoid when:\n- A price or discount: use price-drop.\n- A whole checkout flow: use checkout-flow.\n- Several different products: use bundle-builder.\n\nVariables:\n- product (string): Product name, default \"Kaos Polos\"\n- price (string): Price, default \"Rp89.000\"\n- colors (string): Colours, default \"Hitam|#171717; Krem|#e5dcc8; Sage|#8da08b\"\n- color_pick (number, 1-5): Colour tapped, default 3\n- sizes (string): Sizes, default \"S; M; L; XL\"\n- size_pick (number, 1-5): Size tapped, default 3\n- color_label (string): Colour label, default \"Warna\"\n- size_label (string): Size label, default \"Ukuran\"\n- panel_color (color): Panel colour, default \"#f4f4f5\"\n- bg_color (color): Background, default \"#ffffff\"\n- text_color (color): Text colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- muted_color (color): Muted colour, default \"#737373\"\n- main_color (color): Accent, default \"#2563eb\"\n- font_family (string): Font, default \"Geist\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n\nSource: Mosio original. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
